    "folder": "Sky: Ascendant",
    "img": "icons/magic/water/snowflake-ice-blue-white.webp",
    "name": "Sky: Ascendant (Aquarius)",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>♒ Aquarius is ascendant today.</strong> Your Cloth is awake. For the whole day your Techniques heighten as though you were <strong>4 levels higher</strong>, and you have your Ascendant Boon.</p><p>Any cold damage you deal forces a Fortitude save against your Cosmo DC; on a failure the creature is slowed 1. This is cumulative &mdash; at <strong>slowed 4</strong> it is instead <strong>petrified in ice</strong>, which any critical hit shatters.</p><p>Your cold damage ignores cold resistance and treats cold immunity as resistance 10.</p><hr /><p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Ascendant Constellation]. Applied and removed by the module's sky tracker; a GM can also drag it on by hand.</p>"
        },
